// test-error
// #1863 review: a suffixed literal was never checked against its type, so
// `u8[300u8]` sized 300; and a comparison ignored its operands' types, so
// `N > -1` with a u32 N was true at compile time while C, comparing against
// UINT_MAX, computes false. Both are E0910.
//
// NEGATIVE CONTROLS: `255u8` fits, and `N > 1` compares in range.

const u32 N <- 5;
u8[300u8] wide;
u8[(N > -1) ? 8 : 1] signedCompare;
u8[255u8] fits;
u8[(N > 1) ? 8 : 1] inRange;

void main() {}
